/// Gross wages with the same withholding and net cash as the original paystub.
contract paycheck : employment with acme
  employee me
  employer acme
  8_000 USD monthly on 28 into checking #wages
  from 2025-01-28
  -> irs 1_215 USD #federal-tax
  -> payroll-office 612 USD #tax-paid
  -> checking ...

/// The leases carry the same rents and refundable deposits as the source ledger.
contract rent-a : lease with tenant-a
  landlord oak-street
  tenant tenant-a
  2_400 USD monthly on 1 into rental-bank #rent of house
  deposit 2_400 USD
  from 2025-02-01
  until 2025-08-31

contract rent-b : lease with tenant-b
  landlord oak-street
  tenant tenant-b
  2_500 USD monthly on 1 into rental-bank #rent of house
  deposit 2_500 USD
  from 2025-10-01
  until 2025-12-29 // Jamie's landlord contract ends when the house and lease transfer to the buyer.

/// Loan terms drive principal and interest; the journal still supplies each
/// statement balance and payoff amount for independent reconciliation.
contract home-loan with lender
  loan 279_000 USD on 2024-12-18 at 6.75% over 30y for house
  monthly on 1 from rental-bank
  from 2025-02-01

/// The manager's 8% fee was 192 USD on ordinary 2,400 USD rent, with explicit
/// restatements for the late fee and tenant B's 2,500 USD rent.
contract manager-fee : management with hartwell-pm
  client me
  manager hartwell-pm
  about 192 USD monthly on 5 from rental-bank #management of house
  from 2025-03-05
  until 2025-12-31
